<venant. carm. 2.9.3>	iam dudum obliti desueto carmine plectri
<venant. carm. 2.9.4>	cogitis antiquam me renovare lyram.
<venant. carm. 2.9.5>	en stupidis digitis stimulatis tangere cordas,
<venant. carm. 2.9.6>	cum mihi non solito currat in arte manus.
<venant. carm. 2.9.7>	scabrida nunc resonat mea lingua rubigine verba
<venant. carm. 2.9.8>	exit et incompto raucus ab ore fragor.
<venant. carm. 2.9.9>	vix dabit in veteri ferrugine cotis acumen
<venant. carm. 2.9.10>	aut fumo infecto splendet in aere color.
<venant. carm. 2.9.11>	sed quia dulcedo pulsans quasi malleus instat,
<venant. carm. 2.9.12>	et velut incudo cura relisa terit
<venant. carm. 2.9.13>	pectoris atque mei succenditis igne caminum,
<venant. carm. 2.9.14>	unde ministratur cordis in arce vapor:
<venant. carm. 2.9.15>	obsequor hinc, quia me veluti fornace recocto
<venant. carm. 2.9.16>	artis ad officium vester adegit amor.
<venant. carm. 2.9.17>	Celsa Parisiaci clerus reverentia pollens.
<venant. carm. 2.9.18>	ecclesiae genium gloria munus honor,
