<venant. carm. 5.2.6>	principis egregii vomere culta Petri;
<venant. carm. 5.2.7>	Paulus ad Illyricos Scythicas penetrando pruinas
<venant. carm. 5.2.8>	dogmate ferventi frigora solvit humi;
